WEBVTT

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:03.560
Pshuuu...

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:06.140
Lessons are so tiring-pri.

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:15.360
I wonder how Jululu's doing?

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.630
I want to see you, Jululu...

00:02:02.510 --> 00:02:06.980
For Those Greatest Three Years

00:02:11.390 --> 00:02:14.830
God's will! We've done all we can!

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:16.770
I've done more!

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:21.080
Every day, every thing, every time max!

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:24.620
I also let loose and relaxed!

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.880
Welcome back-usa!

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:33.030
I was so worried-usa!

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:37.260
So, how did the training go?

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:39.730
Worry not!

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:41.950
In our last duel with

00:02:43.070 --> 00:02:45.670
Garumageddon, we won, but

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:48.690
I can't deny there were gaps in our performance.

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:52.490
But the naivety of that time!

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:54.270
And the hunger!

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:55.840
Have gone with the spirit of rock!

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:58.200
We're totally rock!

00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:01.800
We've also made some awesome making dramas.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:04.200
What's up?

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:09.240
Doing lessons and making making dramas...

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:13.740
To see that you three who were aways disagreeing then fighting,

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:17.530
have matured so much, it moved me to tears-usa!

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:20.840
This manager is frowned upon by fortune-usa!

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.720
Hey, hey, don't cry!

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:25.260
Save it until after we win!

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:28.610
Exactly, save those tears.

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:31.170
Until we're Divine Idols!

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:34.460
Gotcha-usa!

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:35.840
Do your best tomorrow-usa!

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:39.450
As a manager, there's nothing left to say-usa!

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:43.320
Lala, what about your lessons?

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:44.800
I have none today.

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:46.510
But the finals...

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:48.040
Aren't they tomorrow?

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:50.340
The tournament has gone on for so long,

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:55.190
Mirei said I should take it easy and rest up today.

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:57.750
But what about your making drama?

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:00.400
No problems! we can do it perfectly.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:01.870
Woah, awesome!

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:04.480
Mum, Dad, you worry too much!

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:08.980
Onee-chan and her friends are way past that level now.

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:12.320
They've already done everything they need to.

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:16.080
So much so that you could say they're perfect.

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:18.020
Right, Onee-chan?

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:20.110
I guess so.

00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:25.870
I guess you know what she's up to more than anyone, since you competed against her after all.

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:31.210
Okay, I'm off!

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:32.230
Me too!

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:36.750
As I thought I can't just sit back and take it easy!

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:37.870
Gotta practice!

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:41.210
Haven't you done everything you need to!?

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:43.480
What about you?

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.460
I'm planning to meet up with Chiri and Pepper

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.140
You're such good friends, you only just met!

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:53.850
I'll go on ahead.

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:56.340
Okay, see you later.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:58.610
Lala.

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:00.020
Falulu.

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:03.010
Falulu has just woken up.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:05.100
I-I see...

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.060
Good morning!

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:11.350
Morning, Falulu had a dream, you know?

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:12.270
A dream?

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:14.460
Yeah, Jewlie...

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:15.500
Jewlie?

00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:19.440
She was alone, looking at a picture of Lala.

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:21.160
At a picture?

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:23.390
She looked lonely.

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:42.320
Jululu, I won't let you disappear.

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:44.920
I'll definitely save you!

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:47.120
And to do that...

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:51.370
I've gotta beat Dressing Pafe and become a Divine Idol!

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:56.210
But they've been training pretty hard, from what I can tell.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:02.150
No, I can't get shook.

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:03.830
We did beat Tricolore after all!

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.050
We can definitely beat them!

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:12.680
Dorothy?

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:15.260
You're back from your training?

00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:18.310
Yeah, we just got back!

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:22.020
I was just in the neighbourhood and heard a loud noise.

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:24.760
I just dropped this Okonomiyaki tool.

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:29.470
Heh "just in the neighbourhood", you came to spy on us didn't you?

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:30.990
No I didn't!

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:34.730
Anyway, how did your training go?

00:06:35.050 --> 00:06:37.240
It was max perfect!

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:38.830
To put it in Okonomiyaki terms,

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:43.380
it was just like having everything on it!

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:46.530
I guess you could call it, the Divine Special!

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:48.660
How about you?

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:50.340
Our training was good,

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:55.980
it was like a margerita pizza with all the toppings!

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:57.320
What!?

00:06:57.320 --> 00:07:00.730
Well ours was better, like mine but with ten spatulas!

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:03.860
In that case, we had fifteen forks!

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:06.320
Twenty-five fancy cups!

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:12.250
It's the day before the final, what are we doing?

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:13.250
No idea.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:18.690
I was preparing for the Okonomiyaki party we're having at PriPara.

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:20.900
You guys wanna come?

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:28.910
I don't know why, I just felt like coming here-pri.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.570
I don't know why, I just felt like coming here.

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:35.720
Why are you here-pri?
Why are you here?

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:40.000
I don't know why, I just felt like coming here-kuma.

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:43.140
I don't know why, I just felt like coming here-usa.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:46.270
Why are you here-usa!?
Why are you here-kuma!?

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:55.890
We came here because we think the same way.

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.310
I guess you could say it was telepathy-pri.

00:07:58.310 --> 00:08:00.770
"Kindred spirits" is more befitting for the situation.

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:06.160
I saw you beat Tricolore in the semi-final.

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:10.040
I guess you could say "desperate prayer" fits the situation though actually...

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:14.440
White crows and unicorns don't exist.

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:21.760
But, by praying really hard, the crow's head became white, and the horse grew a horn.

00:08:21.990 --> 00:08:24.380
I usually use logic to refute stuff like that,

00:08:24.380 --> 00:08:25.860
but it's exactly as you say-pri.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:30.300
Honestly, I thought that before our battle with Tricolore, that

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:32.880
we practically had zero percent chance of winning-pri.

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:36.490
You're calculations are always way off.

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:39.410
By the way-pri.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:42.470
I heard that you beat AI Go #7-pri.

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:47.500
But it wasn't a miracle, it was pure effort!

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:58.020
And tomorrow, we'll defeat you with pure effort.

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:06.870
It's finally here...

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:10.590
T-The final-kuma...

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:14.210
You've not got to tell me that-usa!

00:09:14.390 --> 00:09:16.450
It's all I can think about.

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:23.750
You two sure are a bunch of nerves, you're frozen solid-nekon!

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:37.400
But when I thaw, out comes my fighting spirit-kuma!

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:40.080
We'll put an end to Dressing Pafe tomorrow-kuma!

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:42.130
Wash your face with Miso soup and just wait and see-kuma!

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:43.210
We'll show you!

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:45.720
How dare you-usa!

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:54.110
Let's have a fair battle tomorrow!

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:55.790
You betcha-pri!

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:57.250
Look out!

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:08.810
T-Thanks.

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:10.760
You're welcome.

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:13.740
I don't want to see you get injured before tomorrow.

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:34.990
Onee-sama, why are you cleaning?

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:37.910
We get dust up here too.

00:10:38.470 --> 00:10:41.650
Once I saw it, I just couldn't resist.

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:45.630
Liar, you're just confused, aren't you?

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:51.660
And you're cleaning to forget those feelings.

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:55.640
Be honest with me, Onee-sama.

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:58.880
You want to stay in PriPara, don't you?

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:03.210
That's not true, I'll accept my fate.

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:05.360
That's a Goddesses duty.

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:10.000
And then you'll protect PriPara in my place.

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:12.110
So I'm okay.

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:19.260
How was having a mother?

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:26.520
When I became a baby, I still retained my intelligence, so...

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:29.900
How was having a mother?

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:37.420
She made me relaxed, and she was a happy and hard worker.

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:40.980
She was very cute.

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:47.030
And every now and again, she'd get angry!

00:11:48.690 --> 00:11:49.780
Onee-sama.

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:55.010
It sure is nice out.

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:57.660
Yeah, it is very nice out.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:00.210
But tomorrow...

00:12:00.520 --> 00:12:01.760
But tomorrow...

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:05.050
I won't lose, to the likes of you!

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:07.680
Me neither, come at me!

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:18.520
Sophie, let's be like this tomorrow!

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:28.400
You'll become all soft like mochi-kuma!

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:33.420
You'll become all sloppy like soba noodles with no soup-usa!

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:36.520
You two are eating too much-nekon.

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:39.590
But-kuma...

00:12:39.810 --> 00:12:41.070
But-usa...

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:44.190
I love you-usa!
I love you-kuma!

00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:45.910
Healthy competition...

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:50.700
This is true friendship between two males, so beautiful-nekon.

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:52.990
You're tougher than I thought-kuma!

00:12:53.550 --> 00:12:55.460
You too-usa!

00:12:58.700 --> 00:12:59.820
Sorry,

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:04.280
Leona went out to buy sauce, but didn't come back.

00:13:04.690 --> 00:13:06.030
S-Sorry?

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:08.720
Ah, should I carry that too?

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:11.630
I-It's fine!

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:15.060
You'll make me do something later if you do.

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:17.960
As if, what do you take me for?

00:13:20.930 --> 00:13:22.470
By the way, isn't this where...

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:29.420
No! My beloved PriPara...

00:13:30.260 --> 00:13:31.240
No!

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.160
Don't cry.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:36.230
I'm not crying, honestly!

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:38.180
If you say so, Dorothy.

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:39.970
Don't copy Leona!

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:44.880
Dorothy, you cried then didn't you?

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.550
Yeah, thanks for then.

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:52.000
J-Just what is up with you today?

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:54.640
You're totally different, it's weird.

00:13:55.700 --> 00:14:00.200
Well when I think about the fact that I'll be a Divine Idol soon, I become nicer to people.

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:04.450
Is this what it's like being a Goddess?

00:14:06.690 --> 00:14:09.520
W-What's going on? Is it because of the training?

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:17.400
The reason I decided to become an idol was...

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:21.190
It's Solami Smile, they're so cute!

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:24.360
They'll definitely become Divine Idols!

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:26.280
Become Divine Idols?

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.150
She who dares, wins!

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:31.930
To conquer the world I'll take on these three first!

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:37.430
So you became an idol because you admired us-pri?

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:40.780
Ah Lala, it's too early-pri.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:42.430
R-Really?

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:49.130
No! It's just when I became the World Go Champion,

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:52.720
I was at the peak, with no challengers in sight.

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:55.330
So I searched for new foes.

00:14:55.690 --> 00:14:56.440
Dorothy!

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:58.620
Pass me the seaweed.

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:00.180
It'll get stuck in your teeth.

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:02.690
Idols don't get it stuck in their teeth!

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:07.070
Everyone, the yakisoba pasta is done.

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:09.320
I'll have some.

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:13.780
Shion, what have you done-pri!?

00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:17.080
To draw against me, you've got potential.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:19.430
Friend Ticket Exchange!

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:22.370
You forced me to snap-pri.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:26.150
Only because I thought I'd found a new rival then.

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:29.990
Basically, I saw potential in you all.

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:34.620
So, you never thought of us as rivals until that point?

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:38.130
Yeah, I'd heard you were an up and coming team, but

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:40.820
I thought I'd beat you out right away.

00:15:41.060 --> 00:15:43.140
What do you mean by that-pri?

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:45.540
Now now, don't get mad.

00:15:45.800 --> 00:15:47.570
What the hell...!?

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:50.280
By the way Sophie, did you know?

00:15:50.280 --> 00:15:52.030
At first, instead of you.

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:55.720
Leona and I tried to make a team with Lala and Mirei.

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:58.320
Yeah, I knew!

00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:02.480
This is Leona, we're twins!

00:16:02.780 --> 00:16:04.960
We come as a pair, so let's get along!

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:08.140
I wasn't told about that-pri!

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:10.690
To enter the Grand Prix it has to be a trio!

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:14.910
Leona and I, we come as a pair.

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:21.870
I bet you're kicking yourselves so badly for not taking us on now.

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:23.410
Not at all.

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:27.370
If we did make a team, what would our name be? SoRaDoRe?

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:29.690
DoRaSoRe? DoReSoRa?

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.840
Nah, we are and always will be...

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:34.180
Dressing Pafe!

00:16:34.810 --> 00:16:37.400
Dorothy, you have seaweed stuck in your teeth.

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:39.310
Eh? Really!?

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:42.040
Dorothy, getting lax will lead to your undoing.

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:43.190
You too Shion.

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:44.280
Here!

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:49.440
I-I-I can't believe it!

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:52.320
H-How embarrassing!

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:54.250
What do you think?

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:59.960
When I thought I was a jellyfish and swam around,

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:03.050
I got told "you're a mushroom".

00:17:03.650 --> 00:17:09.180
But I'm a jellyfish, are jellyfish mushrooms?

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:12.240
And that's how I felt.

00:17:12.530 --> 00:17:14.220
I don't understand at all.

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:19.140
At that time I really didn't know how to talk to Sophie.

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:22.980
I was so confused, I ended up regretting it in the end.

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:25.560
Shion, how about some mushrooms?

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:26.830
T-Thanks.

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:31.460
Wanna do a concert together later?

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:34.310
What are you on about-pri?

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:36.550
We're rivals at the moment-pri!

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:39.650
I know, but just like that time...

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:43.230
At the PriPara Debut Christmas Eve.

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:51.540
Solami Smile and Dressing Pafe were blessed with the Paradise Coord and had to compete, but...

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:54.050
Lala, what's up-pri?

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:58.890
Do we have to beat Dressing Pafe?

00:17:58.890 --> 00:17:59.730
Huh!?

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:03.890
We vow to do concerts!

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:06.790
Dressing Pafe, I want to talk to you!

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:12.650
I didn't believe her at first, but

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:16.110
when I thought about it, I realized it was a great idea-pri!

00:18:16.310 --> 00:18:17.990
What do you think-pri?

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:20.530
Okay.

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:22.900
Dorothy-san...

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:26.140
Well I'll be the one standing out the most!

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:27.740
I wanna do it too!

00:18:27.740 --> 00:18:30.530
Sounds interesting, count me in!

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:34.420
Okay.

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:36.270
I wanna do it too!

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:37.940
Count me in!

00:18:37.940 --> 00:18:40.080
A memory before our duel-pri!

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:40.730
Yeah.

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:44.040
Well I'll be the one standing out the most!

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:45.380
She's back...

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:59.140
Scan the MyTickets needed for your coord.

00:18:59.940 --> 00:19:02.190
You can also scan your friend tickets.

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:04.250
Coord Change Start!

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:07.580
Everyone's matching wearing a check gingham fabric!

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:11.480
Perfect coord for the six of you, all friends and all rivals!

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:15.410
Wish Ribbon Nocturne Sky Idol Coord!

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:30.610
Making Drama, switch on!

00:21:04.230 --> 00:21:06.900
Cyalume Change!

